- [HTTP authorization](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-11-25/basic/authorization)
- [Tools and tool security](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-11-25/server/tools)
- [Resources and URI security](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-11-25/server/resources)
